			"notes": "* Improve line rendering (no longer one pixel wide on systems that do not support lineWidth)\n* Add OutlineBox shape (a box with a line around the edges)\n* First version of static text rendering. OutlineBox may have some text supplied, which will render on the outside faces of the box.\n  * Would like to render text on the inside of the box in the future\n  * Would like to adjust font size based on the width of the text (currently only based on the box size, so text can overflow)\n  * Would like to support multiple lines"
